      "cases": [
        "AK26111613"
      ],
      "title": "Driving with a revoked license: Calvin Miller",
      "body": [
        "Calvin Miller, 27, of Fairbanks was issued a court summons on a charge of driving while license revoked — driving after the state had taken his license away.",
        "Troopers say they stopped a vehicle traveling at a high rate of speed and showing multiple equipment violations, and that the investigation showed Miller's license status was revoked. He was also issued several traffic citations. He was not arrested.",
        "Nenana, Nov. 11 at about 2:02 p.m.; Alaska State Troopers. No court case had been opened in the matter as of Nov. 12."
      ],
